  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nWould like to import tool libraries.\n\nWhat format(s) do we want to support? json?\n\nNot sure how to do the mapping of fields from the Vendor to the fields in CamCraft. It might make sense for us to add an export of our tools, so we can use that as the format for importing.\n\n- examples that the vendor probably supports: Haas, Harvey, Sandvik, and Tormach has starter tool libraries\n- Lakeshore Carbide: go thru their web page an create? \n- Generic: Should we create the most common tools (various SAE and metric) like flat, round, drills, etc.\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\nThere would be a screen (or screens) that would prompt the user if they want to import tools. Open file, import.\n\nBest way to handle duplicates?\n\nAre there some fields that are required?\n\n",
